# Normally leave this UNSET.
#
# Unset, the browser calls "/api" (proxied to the backend by next.config.ts) and
# server components call loopback directly. That works both in `next dev` and in
# the single-service Docker deploy, with no CORS involved.
#
# Set it only when the frontend must talk to a backend on a DIFFERENT origin -
# e.g. a split two-service deploy. Then the backend also needs that origin in its
# own FRONTEND_ORIGINS, or every request fails CORS.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://dwellio-api.onrender.com
